# T34 - indented comment is ignored (line still counts); CONVERT with S/X is a type error
PROGRAM 8 0 5.00 12 4
   # indented comment
COURSE C1 REGULAR 4 CORE -
COURSE TH THESIS 4 CORE -
STUDENT S1 Asha
REGISTER S1 C1 1
GRADE S1 C1 1 A
REGISTER S1 TH 2
GRADE S1 TH 2 S
CONVERT S1 TH S
CONVERT S1 TH X
CONVERT S1 TH Q
CONVERT S1 C1 B
CONVERT S1 TH B
GPA S1
